            <description><![CDATA[<p>The first stable release. Since 0.2.1:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Network shares are shown by default. If you haven't changed "Volumes shown" in settings, they now appear in the popover; turn off "network" there to hide them again.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
