            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>The menu bar item takes less room in the Icon and Space styles: 44 and 48 pt instead of 76 pt. During a transfer, the Icon and Space styles show the rates without the trace; the Activity styles keep it.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
